      * NATIONAL TO ALPHANUMERIC THROUGH DISPLAY-OF: ACCEPT.
      * THE SAME ITEMS AS ZE146N; THE CONVERSION IS EXPLICIT.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE146P.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  ITEM-N PIC N(3) USAGE NATIONAL VALUE N'ABC'.
       01  ITEM-X PIC X(6).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE FUNCTION DISPLAY-OF(ITEM-N) TO ITEM-X.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM ZE146P.
